    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Thanksgiving for God’s Deliverance"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Give thanks to the Lord, for he is good;",
          "his faithful love endures forever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let the redeemed of the Lord proclaim",
          "that he has redeemed them from the power of the foe"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and has gathered them from the lands —",
          "from the east and the west,",
          "from the north and the south."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Some wandered in the desolate wilderness,",
          "finding no way to a city where they could live."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They were hungry and thirsty;",
          "their spirits failed within them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then they cried out to the Lord in their trouble;",
          "he rescued them from their distress."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He led them by the right path",
          "to go to a city where they could live."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let them give thanks to the Lord",
          "for his faithful love",
          "and his wondrous works for all humanity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For he has satisfied the thirsty",
          "and filled the hungry with good things."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Others sat in darkness and gloom —",
          "prisoners in cruel chains —"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "because they rebelled against God’s commands",
          "and despised the counsel of the Most High."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He broke their spirits with hard labor;",
          "they stumbled, and there was no one to help."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then they cried out to the Lord in their trouble;",
          "he saved them from their distress."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He brought them out of darkness and gloom",
          "and broke their chains apart."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let them give thanks to the Lord",
          "for his faithful love",
          "and his wondrous works for all humanity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For he has broken down the bronze gates",
          "and cut through the iron bars."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Fools suffered affliction",
          "because of their rebellious ways and their iniquities."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They loathed all food",
          "and came near the gates of death."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then they cried out to the Lord in their trouble;",
          "he saved them from their distress."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He sent his word and healed them;",
          "he rescued them from their traps."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let them give thanks to the Lord",
          "for his faithful love",
          "and his wondrous works for all humanity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let them offer thanksgiving sacrifices",
          "and announce his works with shouts of joy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Others went to sea in ships,",
          "conducting trade on the vast water."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They saw the Lord’s works,",
          "his wondrous works in the deep."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He spoke and raised a stormy wind",
          "that stirred up the waves of the sea. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Rising up to the sky, sinking down to the depths,",
          "their courage melting away in anguish,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "they reeled and staggered like a drunkard,",
          "and all their skill was useless."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then they cried out to the Lord in their trouble,",
          "and he brought them out of their distress."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He stilled the storm to a whisper,",
          "and the waves of the sea were hushed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They rejoiced when the waves grew quiet.",
          "Then he guided them to the harbor they longed for."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let them give thanks to the Lord",
          "for his faithful love",
          "and his wondrous works for all humanity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let them exalt him in the assembly of the people",
          "and praise him in the council of the elders."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He turns rivers into desert,",
          "springs into thirsty ground,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and fruitful land into salty wasteland,",
          "because of the wickedness of its inhabitants."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He turns a desert into a pool,",
          "dry land into springs."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          36
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He causes the hungry to settle there,",
          "and they establish a city where they can live."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          37
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They sow fields and plant vineyards",
          "that yield a fruitful harvest."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          38
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He blesses them, and they multiply greatly;",
          "he does not let their livestock decrease."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          39
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When they are diminished and are humbled",
          "by cruel oppression and sorrow,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          40
        ],
        "lines": [
          "he pours contempt on nobles",
          "and makes them wander in a trackless wasteland."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          41
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But he lifts the needy out of their suffering",
          "and makes their families multiply like flocks."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          42
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The upright see it and rejoice,",
          "and all injustice shuts its mouth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          43
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let whoever is wise pay attention to these things",
          "and consider the Lord’s acts of faithful love."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
